<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela's banks and markets closed Monday.</title>
<headline>Venezuela's banks and markets closed Monday.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's banks and markets will be closed Monday for a national holiday in observance of All Saints' Day.</p>
<p>They will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
